{
  "about": "The package contract: which strings are identities and versions, the package key of an identity (its / as __, one Firestore document id and one path segment), and the limits report-server takes from other components. Asserted by report-server (ReportServer.Packages.Identity, ReportServer.Packages.Manifest) and by the researcherDashboard function (run-package.ts, firestore-paths.ts, derive-profile.ts). The runner and the dashboard app assert against it too; the runner's contract:check fetches this file from report-service's master at fixtures/package-contract.json, so its path and keys are a contract. limits.max_url_length counts characters: code points in report-server, UTF-16 units in the function, which are never fewer, so a URL the function keeps always passes report-server. Two copies keep their own grammar on purpose: rigse's RunRequest, which only sees identities the catalog resolved, and cc-data's package init name check, which runs before report-server has seen anything.",
